    "Summary": "Provides console and chat administration, permissions and moderation for dedicated servers.",
    "Description": "Provides console and chat administration, permissions, moderation and host-local records inside one C# library. Add Superuser Bootstrap to your game's network scene and enable its editor switch for local testing. Register game commands through the public API and connect your own chat UI through authenticated hooks. Visual admin UI is deferred.",
